  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1225027,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1941: Counter Attack [Subset - Multi] - TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine\n\nTake to the skies in *1941: Counter Attack*, a thrilling vertical-scrolling shooter set against the backdrop of the Western Front during World War II!  Pilot either a P-38 Lightning or the brand-new Mosquito Mk IV as you battle across six intense levels, from the North Atlantic Ocean to the Brandenburg Gate and finally, The Enemy Base. \n\nFace relentless waves of iconic Axis aircraft and ground forces, including the Ju 87 Stuka, Bf 110, Tiger I tanks, and even U-boats!  Six formidable bosses stand between you and victory, including the colossal Leviathan and the infamous German battleship Bismarck. \n\n*Counter Attack* introduces a unique vitality system – take a hit and lose vitality points, but you can continue before total destruction.  Strategic lightning attacks, fueled by life energy, offer devastating power.  Manage your loops wisely; unused loops earn bonus points!  Experience the intensity of aerial combat with stunning visuals and a pulse-pounding soundtrack, all on the TurboGrafx-16/PC Engine."
    },
